    title: "Plan: the owner's audit sentence for the shipped CLI (pinpoint every write, enumerate every scenario, judge each benign) -- five steps: INV-hotib-zukuh-zogos-tilip-gonat-nijon-gofik-godov, WI-jizam-razas-sihap-budol-jinab-lopad-todoj-votip, WI-pakag-farav-jilor-lutik-bosan-pavos-torat-susob, WI-muzah-bubim-zunom-masup-mikab-dajul-bigig-lopaf, WI-bujom-nijag-varal-pinof-tuzuj-falup-vivab-potij, WI-satih-pitaz-gavad-runil-turil-nikub-tikum-hozij"  # b7e5
